### BridgeIQ API Test Suite (.http)
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension, IntelliJ HTTP Client, or curl

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@projectId = 9c874acd-e66d-4775-908c-5f5768f19dab
@pendingMatchId = 8ab0b13d-7138-4234-b6ac-ed8ff1e5f31e

###############################################################################
# 1. Health Check
###############################################################################
### Verify Server Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
# 2. Reports
###############################################################################
### Upload Daily Report (Raw Free-Text Payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uploaded_by": "Field Supervisor (Tank Farm)",
  "file_type": "free-text",
  "text_content": "Three spools for Line 24 were erected near Tank Farm Area A today. Welding underway."
}

### Upload Daily Report (Multipart Form with File)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploaded_by"

Amit Gohain (Piping Supervisor)
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="daily-log.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Line 24 spool hydrotest completed successfully. Pressure held at 45 bar for 4 hours.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### List All Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports

### List Reports Filtered by Status (pending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?status=pending

### List Reports Filtered by Status (processed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?status=processed


###############################################################################
# 3. Schedule Activities
###############################################################################
### List All Activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities

### List Activities Filtered by Discipline (piping)
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities?discipline=piping

### List Activities Filtered by Discipline (civil)
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities?discipline=civil

### Seed Activities from CSV File (reads server-side ./seed-data/schedule.csv)
POST {{baseUrl}}/activities/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}


###############################################################################
# 4. Semantic Matches & Confidence Tiering
###############################################################################
### List All Matches (Joined with Activity Code and Extracted Event)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches

### List Matches Awaiting Planner Review (70-95% confidence)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches?status=pending

### List Auto-Approved Matches (>= 95% confidence)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches?status=auto_approved

### List Matches Requiring Manual Resolution (< 70% confidence)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches?status=manual_resolution

### Approve Match (Planner Review Action)
# Updates status to planner_approved, records timestamp, and writes to audit_log
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pendingMatchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "planner_approved",
  "resolved_by": "Senior Planner (Oil India Limited)"
}

### Reject Match (Alternative Planner Action)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{pendingMatchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "rejected",
  "resolved_by": "Discipline Lead (Piping)"
}


###############################################################################
# 5. Audit Log (Immutable Verification Trail)
###############################################################################
### List All Audit Log Entries (Most Recent First)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-log

### Filter Audit Log by Specific Match ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-log?match_id={{pendingMatchId}}

### Filter Audit Log by Approver (AI auto-approvals vs. human planners)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-log?approver=ai
